        {
          "text": "Baluki mwanace jwa Sabayi ŵataŵile mbali jine ja lipupalyo mpaka kuja kwika pa mlango wakwinjilila ku nyumba ja Eliyashibu jwamkulungwa jwa ŵakutaga mbopesi.",
