        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵakutaga mbopesi ŵakuyicisyaŵa ŵataŵile mbali syejinji sya lipupa: Ŵakutaga mbopesi ŵakutyocela ku dela jakusyungulila msinda wa Yelusalemu ŵataŵile mbali jine ja lipupalyo.",
