              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Benjamini ni Hashubu ŵataŵile mbali jine ja lipupalyo, jijaliji ku meso kwa nyumba syawo; Asaliya, mwanace jwa Maaseya soni ŵiŵaliji cisukulu ca Ananiya ŵataŵile mbali jine ja lipupalyo, jijaliji ku meso kwa nyumba jawo.",
          "type": "text",
