              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Palali mwanace jwa Usayi ŵataŵile mbali jine ja lipupalyo ni sanja ja nyumba ja penani ja mwenye ciŵandika ni ku luŵala lwa alonda. Kaneko Pedaya mwanace jwa Paloshi ŵataŵile mbali jine ja lipupalyo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.25"
            ]
          }
        },
