              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sadoki mwanace jwa Imeli, ŵataŵile soni mbali jine ja lipupa mwakulolegana ni nyumba jakwe. Shemaya mwanace jwa Shekaniya juŵalolelaga Cipata ca ku Ngopoko Lyuŵa, ŵataŵile mbali jine ja lipupalyo.",
          "type": "text",
