          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hananiya mwanace jwa Shelemiya, ni Hanuni mwanace jwa msano ni jumo jwa Salafu, ŵataŵile soni mbali jine ja lipupalyo, jeleji jaliji mbali jaŵili. Meshulamu mwanace jwa Belekiya ŵataŵile soni mbali jine ja lipupalyo mwakulolegana ni nyumba jakwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
